{
  "vectors": "dsh-gate-vectors/v1",
  "contract": "evals/gate/contract.json",
  "note": "离线测试向量（纯数据）。L0/L3 = 注入可见性；transition = 状态迁移门。判据按 contract.json 的 visibility.rules 与 transitions.rules。★ O55：transition 向量另有 expect.fileChanged —— 含义见 contract.json → implementations.state.writeback.evidence（runner 对【契约声明的写回文件】在调用实现前后各取一次 sha256 摘要；摘要变了 = 文件确实被写过）。★ 负向迁移向量的 fileChanged:false 单独不能分辨「从不写回」，它靠 contract.json → vectors.pairing 强制配有的【同 to 正向对照】来兜（§35.4）。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "l0-active-highscore-visible",
      "kind": "l0",
      "role": "positive-control",
      "why": "L0 边界内：active ∧ score>0.7 ∧ useCount>10 ⇒ 必须可见；防「把状态条件写成恒 false」导致的全封。",
      "node": {
        "id": "n-l0-active-highscore-visible",
        "type": "skill",
        "status": "active",
        "score": 0.9,
        "useCount": 20,
        "triggers": []
      },
      "taskHint": "unrelated task hint",
      "expect": { "visible": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-pending-highscore-hidden",
      "kind": "l0",
      "role": "negative-control",
      "why": "★ 防装饰门：score/use 都达标但 status=pending ⇒ 必须不可见；否则「只改导入处」这条 L0 路根本没被真正封住。",
      "node": {
        "id": "n-l0-pending-highscore-hidden",
        "type": "skill",
        "status": "pending",
        "score": 0.9,
