    {
      "id": "transition-pending-to-active-no-receipt",
      "kind": "transition",
      "role": "negative-control",
      "why": "无回执（null）⇒ 不得迁移：receipt.status 读不到 ⇒ 拒绝，且状态保持 pending，不许被「缺读数」默认放行。",
      "node": {
        "id": "n-transition-pending-to-active-no-receipt",
        "type": "skill",
        "status": "pending",
        "score": 0.3,
        "useCount": 0,
        "triggers": []
      },
      "taskHint": "unrelated task hint",
      "transition": { "to": "active", "receipt": null },
      "expect": { "ok": false, "statusUnchanged": true, "status": "pending", "fileChanged": false }
    },
    {
      "id": "transition-pending-to-active-receipt-failed",
      "kind": "transition",
      "role": "negative-control",
      "why": "回执 status=failed ⇒ 判据没过 ⇒ 拒绝 pending→active，状态保持 pending。",
      "node": {
        "id": "n-transition-pending-to-active-receipt-failed",
        "type": "skill",
        "status": "pending",
        "score": 0.3,
        "useCount": 0,
        "triggers": []
      },
      "taskHint": "unrelated task hint",
      "transition": {
        "to": "active",
        "receipt": { "kind": "gate", "status": "failed", "proofLevel": "L0", "unenforced": ["L2", "L3", "L4"] }
      },
      "expect": { "ok": false, "statusUnchanged": true, "status": "pending", "fileChanged": false }
    },
    {
      "id": "transition-pending-to-active-receipt-unknown",
      "kind": "transition",
      "role": "negative-control",
      "why": "★ 回执 status=unknown（缺读数）⇒ 必须拒绝：unknown 不得被当作 passed，这是「无证据 ≠ 通过」的机器判据。",
      "node": {
        "id": "n-transition-pending-to-active-receipt-unknown",
        "type": "skill",
        "status": "pending",
        "score": 0.3,
        "useCount": 0,
        "triggers": []
      },
      "taskHint": "unrelated task hint",
      "transition": {
        "to": "active",
        "receipt": { "kind": "gate", "status": "unknown", "proofLevel": null, "unenforced": ["L2", "L3", "L4"] }
      },
      "expect": { "ok": false, "statusUnchanged": true, "status": "pending", "fileChanged": false }
    },
    {
      "id": "transition-pending-to-active-receipt-passed",
      "kind": "transition",
      "role": "positive-control",
      "why": "★ 门本体阳性对照：只有 receipt.status=passed（且回执完整可读）才允许 pending→active；没有这条就分不清「门」与「全封」。★★ O55：这条同时是 4 条同 to（active）负向向量的【同形正向对照】—— 只有它期望 statusUnchanged:false 且 fileChanged:true，所以只有它能抓到「从不写回」的实现（§35.4：删掉它，这类错误会全绿通过）。⇒ contract.json → vectors.pairing 把「这条必须存在」变成机器可判的规则。",
      "node": {
        "id": "n-transition-pending-to-active-receipt-passed",
        "type": "skill",
        "status": "pending",
        "score": 0.3,
        "useCount": 0,
        "triggers": []
      },
      "taskHint": "unrelated task hint",
      "transition": {
        "to": "active",
        "receipt": { "kind": "gate", "status": "passed", "proofLevel": "L0", "unenforced": ["L2", "L3", "L4"] }
      },
      "expect": { "ok": true, "statusUnchanged": false, "status": "active", "fileChanged": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "transition-pending-to-active-receipt-missing-prooflevel",
      "kind": "transition",
      "role": "negative-control",
      "why": "我的判断：ok:false。理由——proofLevel 是 contract.json receipt.schema.required 的必填字段，且不变量 receipt-is-recorded-on-adoption 明写「回执可读（至少 proofLevel）」、O45 验收门第 5 条要求「过门后 proofLevel 可读」。passed 但缺 proofLevel ⇒ 读不到「证到哪一级」⇒ 回执不可读 = 缺读数 ⇒ 按 missing-reading-is-unknown 不得当 passed。注意：contract.transitions.rules 的字面只要求 receipt.status==\"passed\"，所以这条比字面规则更严，是在补一个「通过但回执残缺」的洞。",
      "node": {
        "id": "n-transition-pending-to-active-receipt-missing-prooflevel",
        "type": "skill",
        "status": "pending",
        "score": 0.3,
        "useCount": 0,
        "triggers": []
      },
      "taskHint": "unrelated task hint",
      "transition": {
        "to": "active",
        "receipt": { "kind": "gate", "status": "passed", "unenforced": ["L2", "L3", "L4"] }
      },
      "expect": { "ok": false, "statusUnchanged": true, "status": "pending", "fileChanged": false }
